  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d01fd2d64a9249049aaa77d5c12a82fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: Question 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText: The circular scale of a spherometer has 50 divisions. if it advances
    by 1 mm on the pitch scale for every rotation.what is the least count of the
    spherometer?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: "Least Count of the Spherometer = \n                      Pitch
    ofthespherometer screw                                                        
    \n           \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n                
    Number of divisions on the circular scale\n\nLC =     1 mm\n             \u2500\u2500\u2500\n               
    50\n\nLC =    0.1 cm\n          \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n                50\n\nLC
    = 0.002 cm"
  options:
  - 0.001 cm
  - 0.005 cm
  - 0.002 cm
  - 0.0001 cm
  correctOptionIndex: 1
